        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "97. A Regular employee is defined as an employee who is regularly employed to work a predetermined work schedule of twenty (20) or more hours per work week. Any employee designated as a Regular employee shall accumulate and receive all of the fringe benefits as provided in this Agreement when he/she becomes and so long as he/she remains a Regular employee.",
